{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Lists every plugin that declares itself in the store, for the shelf's plugins dropdown. A control meant to be mounted as a plugin carries a `plugin` facet: JSON text {name?, target_lib, target_ctl, selector, desc?} giving its default registration (or an array of those for more than one home); name defaults to <lib>-<ctl>. Walks every library's controls index and probes each control's <id>.plugin attachment (one stat per control; no record is read). Takes no input. Returns {plugins:[{name, plugin_lib, plugin_ctl, target_lib, target_ctl, selector, desc, registered (this instance's runtime/dev/plugins.json already mounts this plugin at this target and selector), registered_as (that entry's name), name_taken (the declared name is used by a different registration)}] sorted by plugin, errors:[{lib, ctl, msg}] for declarations that are malformed or incomplete}. Read-only; register one with dev.code.set_plugin.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::data::Data;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"qhqrkh1a1e0c79732x1","readers":[],"time":1794772558875,"username":"system","writers":[]}